<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks followed through on Friday's strength and gained some impetus from overseas markets to move higher in early trading on Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were up five at 6013 and the NASDAQ Index was up three at 1227.</p>
</text>
